start":"2026-11-16T01:00Z","home":"MIL","away":"ATL"},{"start":"2026-11-16T02:00Z","home":"SAC","away":"OKC"}],"news":[{"cat":"Major","title":"FAA halts U.S. departures for 4+ hours in longest ground stop since 9/11","summary":"An air traffic control communications equipment failure, blamed on overloaded routers, stopped departing U.S. flights Friday afternoon; about 9,000 cancellations followed, with 3,000+ more Saturday morning. Officials said it did not appear to be a cyberattack.","source":"CNBC","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/14/faa-ground-stop-flights-resume-delays.html","published":"2026-11-14","id":"n1"},{"cat":"World","title":"Zelenskyy says U.S. raised Donbas withdrawal in exchange for NATO membership","summary":"Zelenskyy said Washington asked for the first time whether Ukraine would leave Donbas if it joined NATO, and said he would put any confirmed terms to Ukrainians. Moscow said the idea was not discussed in its talks with U.S. envoys.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/14/us-floats-ukraine-ceding-land-to-russia-in-exchange-for-nato-membership-zelenskyy","published":"2026-11-14","id":"n2"},{"cat":"World","title":"White House says Trump, Xi and Putin will meet in China next week","summary":"The three leaders are set to meet in Shenzhen on the sidelines of the Nov. 18-19 APEC summit, with Trump planning to raise nuclear arms reduction and the Iran war. Moscow and Beijing had not commented.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/14/trump-xi-and-putin-to-meet-in-china-white-house-says","published":"2026-11-14","id":"n3"},{"cat":"Business","title":"U.S. wholesale prices up 6.5% year over year, highest since 2022","summary":"October PPI rose 0.3% on the month, slightly below forecasts, but the annual rate hit 6.5% and goods prices jumped 10.2%. Markets fully price a quarter-point Fed hike at the Dec. 8-9 meeting.","source":"CNBC","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/13/ppi-inflation-report-october-2026.html","published":"2026-11-13","id":"n4"},{"cat":"AI","title":"Analysis finds China's top AI models likely trained on banned Nvidia chips","summary":"A researcher reported evidence that Moonshot's Kimi K3 and DeepSeek's V4 were trained on export-banned Blackwell GPUs, though the findings don't prove laws were broken. Epoch AI estimates about two million advanced chips reached China via concealed routes in 2024-25.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/13/export-banned-nvidia-chips-are-behind-chinas-most-powerful-ai-models-uh-oh-jensen/","published":"2026-11-13","id":"n5"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"Canada and the Philippines conclude free-trade talks, aim to sign in 2027","summary":"PM Mark Carney and President Ferdinand Marcos Jr. wrapped up negotiations on a bilateral trade deal; two-way merchandise trade was $3.4 billion in 2025. It fits Carney's goal of doubling non-U.S. exports by 2035.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12150796/canada-philippines-trade-deal/","published":"2026-11-13","id":"n6"},{"cat":"Business","title":"Nasdaq falls 0.9% as Nvidia slides, but indexes log best week since August","summary":"On Friday the Dow rose 0.1% to 52,347.55, the S&P 500 fell 0.4% to 7,561.67 and the Nasdaq dropped 0.91% to 25,136.27. Nvidia fell 2% more; for the week the S&P gained 2.5%.","source":"CNBC","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/12/stock-market-today-live-updates.html","published":"2026-11-13","id":"n7"},{"cat":"Major","title":"SpaceX Starship Flight 15 reaches orbit; booster catch aborted","summary":"The upper stage reached orbit and deployed 26 Starlink v3 satellites, with a landing attempt at Starbase planned Saturday. The booster catch was called off and it splashed down in the Gulf of Mexico, bursting into flames.","source":"CNBC","url":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/13/spacex-launches-starship-in-key-test-flight-of-massive-rocket.html","published":"2026-11-13","id":"n8"},{"cat":"World","title":"EU names joint team, not a single envoy, for Ukraine peace talks","summary":"At a Dublin summit, leaders agreed France, Germany, Italy, Poland and the UK, plus EU institutions and NATO, will represent Europe. Kaja Kallas's bid to be sole envoy was not taken up.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/13/eu-leaders-bring-italy-and-poland-into-ukraine-peace-talks-team-as-kallas-fights-for-spot","published":"2026-11-13","id":"n9"},{"cat":"AI","title":"OpenAI launches ChatGPT Wallet so AI agents can shop and check out","summary":"The feature lets ChatGPT agents pick items and complete purchases using tokenized cards, with each purchase approved by Face ID or fingerprint. It starts with a small group of U.S. Pro subscribers.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/13/chatgpts-new-wallet-lets-ai-agents-shop-and-check-out-for-you/","published":"2026-11-13","id":"n10"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"Alberta offers oilsands projects 2% starting royalty to spur investment","summary":"The new Oilsands Growth Program gives eligible new projects and expansions a guaranteed 10-year royalty schedule starting at 2% and rising to 6%. It is open until the end of 2029.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12150290/alberta-oilsands-growth-program-royalties/","published":"2026-11-13","id":"n11"},{"cat":"Business","title":"Fed flags AI-driven valuations and data-centre debt as stability risks","summary":"The Fed's semiannual Financial Stability Report said asset prices sit near the top of historical ranges and called data-centre financing links a vulnerability. Hedge fund leverage is at its highest since 2013.","source":"American Banker via Yahoo Finance","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/economy/policy/articles/fed-warns-financial-risks-ai-225438596.html","published":"2026-11-13","id":"n12"},{"cat":"World","title":"Russian strikes kill 3 in Ukraine; Ukraine hits Volgograd refinery","summary":"At least three people died and over 20 were injured in Russian attacks on Odesa, Zaporizhzhia and Kharkiv regions Friday. Ukraine said it struck the Volgograd oil refinery, and Russian officials reported deaths in Samara and Volgograd.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/13/at-least-three-killed-and-more-than-20-injured-in-russian-strikes-on-ukraine","published":"2026-11-13","id":"n13"},{"cat":"Major","title":"Tanker strikes docked river cruise ship in New Orleans; all 197 accounted for","summary":"The tanker Atlantic Asphalt hit the American Heritage cruise ship at the Port of New Orleans Friday, causing it to flip and partly sink. The port reported no critical injuries.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/13/tanker-collides-with-new-orleans-river-cruise-carrying-129-passengers-rescue-operation-und","published":"2026-11-13","id":"n14"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"Ottawa raises EV luxury-tax exemption threshold to $150,000","summary":"Electric vehicles priced under $150,000 are now exempt from the 10% luxury tax, up from $100,000, Finance Minister François-Philippe Champagne announced. Other vehicles keep the $100,000 threshold.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12149701/electric-vehicles-luxury-tax/","published":"2026-11-13","id":"n15"},{"cat":"AI","title":"Top Democrats open inquiry into Nvidia's China chip export deal","summary":"Rep. Richard Neal and Sen. Ron Wyden asked Commerce to preserve records on H200 sales to China and questioned Nvidia's $26 million in donations to Trump projects. Huang has agreed to testify to House Republicans.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/12/democrats-launch-nvidia-investigation-write-scathing-letter-on-huangs-scheme-with-trump/","published":"2026-11-12","id":"n16"},{"cat":"Canada","title":"Smith to call UCP riding presidents who refused referendum pledge","summary":"Fifteen of 87 UCP constituency presidents declined to sign a pledge to respect the Oct. 19 referendum, in which about 75% voted for Alberta to stay in Canada. Premier Danielle Smith said she would call them.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12150519/ucp-officials-alberta-separatism-pledge/","published":"2026-11-13","id":"n17"},{"cat":"World","title":"Iranian lawmakers debate nuclear doctrine shift and leaving the NPT","summary":"Some MPs are pushing to review Iran's nuclear doctrine and withdraw from the Non-Proliferation Treaty, and the Assembly of Experts urged study of an exit. The Foreign Ministry says Iran remains committed to the treaty.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/11/13/iran-mps-debate-possible-shift-in-nuclear-doctrine-and-exit-from-npt","published":"2026-11-13","id":"n18"},{"cat":"AI","title":"LangChain raises $300M at $3B valuation","summary":"The AI agent startup's Series C, led by CapitalG with GIC, IVP and others, more than doubles its $1.25 billion valuation from a year ago. It says LangSmith has 7,000 customers.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/13/ai-agent-startup-langchain-hits-3b-valuation/","published":"2026-11-13","id":"n19"}]}